fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"d3d12/d3d12fisheyedewarp.html#d3d12fisheyedewarp:inner-radius","fragment":"\n\tinner-radius\n\nNormalized inner radius for cropping central area (0.0 = center, 1.0 = full crop). Only used in 'panorama' projection\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t0.3\n\n"});